{"id":"torrey:holy-of-holies","source":"torrey","name":"Holy Of Holies","slug":"holy-of-holies","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Divided from the outward tabernacle by a vail — Ex 26:31-33.","refs":[["Exod",26,31,26,33]]},{"text":"Sanctuary. — Le 4:6; Ps 20:2.","refs":[["Lev",4,6,4,6],["Ps",20,2,20,2]]},{"text":"Holy sanctuary. — Le 16:33.","refs":[["Lev",16,33,16,33]]},{"text":"Holy place. — Ex 28:29; Le 16:2,3.","refs":[["Exod",28,29,28,29],["Lev",16,2,16,2],["Lev",16,3,16,3]]},{"text":"Most holy place. — Ex 26:31-33.","refs":[["Exod",26,31,26,33]]},{"text":"Holiest of all. — Heb 9:3.","refs":[["Heb",9,3,9,3]]},{"text":"Oracle. — 1Ki 6:5,16,20.","refs":[["1Kgs",6,5,6,5],["1Kgs",6,16,6,16],["1Kgs",6,20,6,20]]},{"text":"Ark of testimony. — Ex 26:33; 40:3,21.","refs":[["Exod",26,33,26,33],["Exod",40,3,40,3],["Exod",40,21,40,21]]},{"text":"Mercy-seat. — Ex 26:34.","refs":[["Exod",26,34,26,34]]},{"text":"Cherubim. — Ex 25:18-22; 1Ki 6:23-28.","refs":[["Exod",25,18,25,22],["1Kgs",6,23,6,28]]},{"text":"Golden censer. — Heb 9:4.","refs":[["Heb",9,4,9,4]]},{"text":"Pot of manna. — Ex 16:33; Heb 9:4.","refs":[["Exod",16,33,16,33],["Heb",9,4,9,4]]},{"text":"Aaron’s rod. — Nu 17:10; Heb 9:4.","refs":[["Num",17,10,17,10],["Heb",9,4,9,4]]},{"text":"A written copy of the divine law. — De 31:26; 2Ki 22:8.","refs":[["Deut",31,26,31,26],["2Kgs",22,8,22,8]]},{"text":"God appeared in — Ex 25:22; Le 16:2.","refs":[["Exod",25,22,25,22],["Lev",16,2,16,2]]},{"text":"Not to enter, at all times. — Le 16:2.","refs":[["Lev",16,2,16,2]]},{"text":"Alone to enter, once a year. — Heb 9:7.","refs":[["Heb",9,7,9,7]]},{"text":"Entered, in ordinary priest’s dress. — Le 16:4.","refs":[["Lev",16,4,16,4]]},{"text":"Entered, not without blood of atonement. — Le 16:14,15; Heb 9:7.","refs":[["Lev",16,14,16,14],["Lev",16,15,16,15],["Heb",9,7,9,7]]},{"text":"Offered incense in. — Le 16:12.","refs":[["Lev",16,12,16,12]]},{"text":"Made atonement for. — Le 16:15,16,20,33.","refs":[["Lev",16,15,16,15],["Lev",16,16,16,16],["Lev",16,20,16,20],["Lev",16,33,16,33]]},{"text":"The priests allowed to enter, and prepare the holy things for removal — Nu 4:5.","refs":[["Num",4,5,4,5]]},{"text":"Laid open to view at Christ’s death — Mt 27:51.","refs":[["Matt",27,51,27,51]]},{"text":"A type of heaven — Ps 102:19; Heb 9:12,13,24.","refs":[["Ps",102,19,102,19],["Heb",9,12,9,12],["Heb",9,13,9,13],["Heb",9,24,9,24]]},{"text":"Saints have boldness to enter the true — Heb 10:19.","refs":[["Heb",10,19,10,19]]}],"refCount":45}
